\u003e.\u003c/p\u003e","updatedAt":"2025-05-30T17:57:06.329Z"},{"id":"62b02de6-5bcf-4cc2-8dcf-03770523e948","title":"\u003cp\u003emay 2022\u003c/p\u003e","value":"\u003cp\u003eWent overseas as a \u003cstrong\u003eFulbright Scholar\u003c/strong\u003e working as a High-School \u003cstrong\u003eEnglish Teacher\u003c/strong\u003e in Salzburg, Austria.\u003c/p\u003e","updatedAt":"2025-05-30T06:35:24.771Z"},{"id":"2d6abf2e-67fa-47fc-b1de-fe06193cd73b","title":"\u003cp\u003eaug 2023\u003c/p\u003e","value":"\u003cp\u003eGraduated from \u003cstrong\u003eThe University of Chicago\u003c/strong\u003e with a Masters in International Politics.\u003c/p\u003e","updatedAt":"2025-05-30T17:57:24.072Z"},{"id":"05da1eda-5228-4548-8dd0-1d241a91989c","title":"\u003cp\u003eMay 2025\u003c/p\u003e","value":"\u003cp\u003eWorked as a \u003cstrong\u003eCounterterrorism Analyst\u003c/strong\u003e at the U.S. Dept. of Justice in Washington D.C. \u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: var(--color-text)\"\u003eResigned \u003c/span\u003e\u003c/strong\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: var(--color-text)\"\u003edue to this administrations disregard for the rule of law.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e","updatedAt":"2025-05-30T17:54:35.404Z"},{"id":"432e4564-efae-4dc9-8d4f-811fb6d20b98","title":"\u003cp\u003eNow\u003c/p\u003e","value":"\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eRunning for Congress \u003c/strong\u003eas the youngest candidate in Illinois History.\u003c/p\u003e","updatedAt":"2025-05-30T21:48:41.074Z"}],"bgColor":"bg1","callout":"QUOTE_IMAGE","eyebrow":"a timeline of","headline":"\u003cp\u003eRyan's Achievements\u003c/p\u003e","marginTop":"top-large","headlineOn":true,"quoteImage":"https://run.imgix.net/415b7455-174b-4f9e-9d05-7c9dbda44202/f3282a0d-06c0-4b43-95ca-87977c2108bb/f3282a0d-06c0-4b43-95ca-87977c2108bb.webp?ixlib=js-3.8.0\u0026bri=0\u0026con=0\u0026sat=0\u0026high=0\u0026shad=0\u0026usm=0\u0026rect=0%2C0%2C1920%2C1280","description":"\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e","eyebrowSize":0,"showEyebrow"