a","data":{"date":"2022-09-01T04:00:00.000Z","link":null,"slug":"news-1","title":"Headline goes here","description":"Put your press release text here.","shortDescription":"\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eIf you want to link an external news source,\u003c/strong\u003e use the “link” icons on the sidebar. Anything linked externally will automatically be listed as “news” and any article you create on the site itself will automatically be listed as a “press release.”\u003c/p\u003e","shortExtraDescription":"Lorem Ipsum is simply dummy text of the printing and typesetting industry. Lorem Ipsum has b"},"slug":"news-1","type":"NEWS_LIST","siteId":"f683133e-6417-446e-ac39-6479efbabbee","deleted":false,"createdAt":"2025-05-29T18:52:51.671+00:00","published":true,"updatedAt":"2026-03-02T16:51:03.873692+00:00","primaryPostId":null,"lastTranslatedAt":null},"2af6a636-29ed-47d0-b352-09d4da07c9ef":{"id":"2af6a636-29ed-47d0-b352-09d4da07c9ef","data":{"url":"https://google.com","date":"January 1, 1900","slug":"event-1","fields":[{"name":"firstName","type":"input","label":"First Name","isUnique":true,"isRequired":true},{"name":"lastName","type":"input","label":"Last Name","isUnique":true,"isRequired":true},{"name":"phoneNumber","type":"input","label":"Phone Number","isUnique":true,"isRequired":true},{"name":"zipOrPostalCode","type":"input","label":"ZIP Code","isUnique":true,"isRequired":true},{"name":"email","type":"input","label":"Email","isUnique":true,"inputType":"email","isRequired":true}],"headline":"Event title here","location":{"location":"\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e1234 Maple Street\u003c/strong\u003e\u003cbr\u003eMunicipal, State 12345\u003c/p\u003e"},"wrapForm":true,"blockStyle":"WHITE","description":"Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet, consectetur adipiscing elit, sed do eiusmod tempor incididunt ut labore et dolore magna aliqua.","occurrences":[{"end":"2025-12-31T18:00:00.000Z","start":"2025-12-31T17:00:00.000Z"}],"shortDescription":"Write a short blurb about the event."},"slug":"event-1","type":"EVENTS_LIST","siteId":"f683133e-6417-446e-ac39-6479efbabbee","deleted":false,"createdAt":"2025-05-29T18:52:51.671+00:00","published":true,"updatedAt":"2026-03-02T16:51:03.873692+00:00","primaryPostId":null,"lastTranslatedAt":null},"2a008e65-1335-4247-a820-06287d9cd9d7":{"id":"2a008e65-1335-4247-a820-06287d9cd9d7","data":{"date":"2022-09-01T04:00:00.000Z","link":null,"slug":"news-2","title":"Headline goes here","description":"Put your press release text here.","shortDescription":"\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eIf you want to link an external news source,\u003c/strong\u003e use the “link” icons on the sidebar. Anything linked externally will automatically be listed \u003ca target=\"_blank\" href=\"\"\u003eas “new\u003c/a\u003es” and any article you create on the site itself will automatically be listed as a “press release.”\u003c/p\u003e","shortExtraDescription":"Lorem Ipsum is simply dummy text of the printing and typesetting industry. Lorem Ipsum has b"},"slug":"news-2","type":"NEWS_LIST","siteId":"f683133e-6417-446e-ac39-6479efbabbee","deleted":false,"createdAt":"2025-05-29T18:52:51.671+00:00","published":true,"updatedAt":"2026-03-02T16:51:03.873692+00:00","primaryPostId":null,"lastTranslatedAt":null},"a8ebc9e9-2bde-40a5-96a6-9a72e8212807":{"id":"a8ebc9e9-2bde-40a5-96a6-9a72e8212807","data":{"title":"\u003cp\u003eGun Violence Prevention\u003c/p\u003e","eyebrow":"\u003cp\u003ePlatform\u003c/p\u003e","description":"\u003cp\u003eWe all deserve to feel safe in our schools, neighborhoods, and public spaces. That shouldn’t be a partisan statement—it’s just common sense. Here’s what I’ll push for:\u003c/p\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eComprehensive Background Checks\u003c/strong\u003e: No more loopholes. If you’re buying a gun, you go through a background check—period.\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eMandatory Waiting Periods\u003c/strong\u003e: These save lives. Waiting periods reduce suicides and prevent spur-of-the-moment violence.\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eMandatory Gun Safety Training\u003c/strong\u003e: If we require training to drive a car, we should require it to own a firearm.\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eClose Gun Show and Ghost Gun Loopholes\u003c/strong\u003e: No untraceable weapons, no backdoor sales. Every purchase should follow the same rules.\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cp\u003eWe can protect the Second Amendment and still act to save lives. It's not either-or.\u003c/p\u003e","shortDescription":"\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e"},"slug":"gun-reform","type":"ISSUES_LIST","siteId":"f683133e-6417-446e-ac39-6479efbabbee","deleted":false,"createdAt":"2025-05-30T17:03:48.392982+00:00","published":true,"updatedAt":"2026-03-02T16:51:03.873692+00:00","primaryPostId":null,"lastTranslatedAt":null},"691f2a53-4131-462c-a6c1-3d5912bc21ad":{"id":"691f2a53-4131-462c-a6c1-3d5912bc21ad","data":{"slug":"issue-1","title":"\u003cp\u003eDemocratic Reform\u003c/p\u003e","eyebrow":"\u003cp\u003ePlatform\u003c/p\u003e","highlight":"I helped create hundreds…","description":"\u003cp\u003eIf we want a government that works for everyday people, we have to start by changing how it operates. I’m not interested in vague promises—I’m talking about real, doable changes that make our democracy more fair and more functional.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eCampaign Finance Reform\u003c/strong\u003e:\u003c/p\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eSet real limits on how much candidates can spend. 2 million in Congressional races. \u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eOverturn\u0026nbsp;the Supreme Court Decision of \u003cem\u003eCitizens United\u003c/em\u003e\u0026nbsp;so corporations and billionaires can’t buy our elections with dark money.\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eBan Congressional Stock Trading\u003c/strong\u003e: Elected officials shouldn’t be profiting off the same policies they help write. This one’s a no-brainer.\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eMonthly In-Person Town Halls: \u003c/strong\u003eI'll hold an in-person town hall in the district every month I’m in office. Whether it’s answering questions or helping with constituent services, I’ll make sure everyone in the Eighth District has access to me in a way that’s convenient for them. You deserve to personally know your representative and I want to personally know you.\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e","shortDescription":"\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e","shortExtraDescription":"Write a short blurb about an issue your campaign is highlighting. Try to keep the text a similar size between the various issue blurbs."},"slug":"issue-1","type":"ISSUES_LIST","siteId":"f683133e-6417-446e-ac39-6479efbabbee","deleted":false,"createdAt":"2025-05-29T18:52:51.671+00:00","published":true,"updatedAt":"2026-03-02T16:51:03.873692+00:00","primaryPostId":null,"lastTranslatedAt":null},"0e4eb2ce-b940-49f8-9a05-b6ccd09c112a":{"id":"0e4eb2ce-b940-49f8-9a05-b6ccd09c112a","data":{"title":"\u003cp\u003eAffordability / Healthcare / Social Security\u003c/p\u003e","eyebrow":"\u003cp\u003ePlatform\u003c/p\u003e","description":"\u003cp\u003eIf you feel like you're working harder just to fall further behind, you're not imagining it. The system is stacked—and we need to level the playing field.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003ePrescription Drug Transparency\u003c/strong\u003e: Drug companies shouldn’t be allowed to hide what things actually cost. Americans pay up to 3x more for medicine than people in other countries. That has to change.\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eReverse Ongoing Tariffs\u003c/strong\u003e: The recent tariffs have raised the price of everything from groceries to diapers. They’ve cost families an extra $1,200 a year on average. Let’s lift the ones that hurt consumers.\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eLower Property Taxes\u003c/strong\u003e: Illinois families are paying some of the highest property taxes in the country. We need school funding reform and smarter budgeting to bring relief.\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eMedicare for All\u003c/strong\u003e: Every American deserves healthcare, period. No one should go bankrupt over medical bills. A single-payer option would reduce costs, expand access, and eliminate surprise bills—while still allowing people to choose private insurance if they prefer. This is about giving everyone peace of mind and a fair choice, not taking options away. A single-payer system would drastically cut health care costs for families while ensuring everyone is covered. No co-pays, no surprise bills, no stress.\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eExpand Social Security\u003c/strong\u003e: Social Security is one of the most successful programs in American history. It’s a commitment to workers that after a lifetime of contributions, they’ll have a foundation to retire on. We need to ensure it remains strong and reliable for the next generation by protecting benefits and making smart, responsible updates that reflect today’s economy.\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cp\u003eThis isn’t about handouts—it’s about fairness. People just want a shot to get ahead without being crushed by the basics.\u003c/p\u003e","shortDescription":"\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e"},"slug":"3-part-pledge","type":"ISSUES_LIST","siteId":"f683133e-6417-446e-ac39-6479efbabbee","deleted":false,"createdAt":"2025-05-30T17:03:48.392982+00:00","published":true,"updatedAt":"2026-03-02T16:51:03.873692+00:00","primaryPostId":null,"lastTranslatedAt":null}},"primarySiteId":null,"previewId":"ee61932c-4a1b-4a6e-81d7-5c4eb21a395a","updatedAt":"2026-03-02T16:51:03.873692+00:00","createdAt":"2025-05-29T18:52:51.696626","id":"f683133e-6417-446e-ac39-6479efbabbee","goldenSiteId":"415b7455-174b-4f9e-9d05-7c9dbda44202","hidden":false,"siteGroupId":"f683133e-6417-446e-ac39-6479efbabbee","languageCode":null},"initialPageId":"52c6cfef-feee-4374-95cc-5283efb49b87"},"__N_SSG":true},"page":"/_sites/[domain]/[[...slug]]","query":{"domain":"www.ryanforillinois.com"},"buildId":"5X_2R-mYkFSNYLwO4UzEW","isFallback":false,"isExperimentalCompile":false,"gsp":true,"scriptLoader":[]}</script></body></html>